#: aboutwidget.cpp:45 main.cpp:105
msgid "KDE Control Center"
msgstr "Centróm kòntroli KDE"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:47
msgid "Configure your desktop environment."
msgstr "Nastôwë òkrãzégò KDE."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:49
msgid ""
"Welcome to the \"KDE Control Center\", a central place to configure your "
"desktop environment. Select an item from the index on the left to load a "
"configuration module."
msgstr ""
"Witómë w \"Centróm kòntrolë KDE\", westrzédnëm môlu dlô kònfigùracëji "
"òkrãżégò KDE. Proszã wëbrac mòduł z lëstë z lewi starnë."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:55 main.cpp:109
msgid "KDE Info Center"
msgstr "Centróm wedowiédzë KDE"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:57
msgid "Get system and desktop environment information"
msgstr "Pòbiérzë wëdowiédzã ò systemie ë òkrãżim"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:59
msgid ""
"Welcome to the \"KDE Info Center\", a central place to find information "
"about your computer system."
msgstr ""
"Witómë w \"Centróm wëdowiédzë KDE\", przédnym môlu nalezeniô wëdowiédzë ò "
"Twòjim kòmpùtrze ë systemie."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:63
msgid ""
"Click on the \"Help\" tab on the left to view help for the active control "
"module. Use the \"Search\" tab if you are unsure where to look for a "
"particular configuration option."
msgstr ""
"Klëkni na kôrtã \"Pòmòc\" z lewa, bë òbaczëc pòmòc dlô mòdulu aktiwné "
"kòntrolë. Brëkùjë kôrtë \"Szëkba\" czej të nie jes gwësny dze szëkac "
"òsoblëwi òptacëji kònfigùracëji."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:69
msgid "KDE version:"
msgstr "Wersëjô KDE:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:70
msgid "User:"
msgstr "Brëkòwnik:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:71
msgid "Hostname:"
msgstr "Miono kòmpùtra:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:72
msgid "System:"
msgstr "Systema:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:73
msgid "Release:"
msgstr "Wersëjô:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:74
msgid "Machine:"
msgstr "Architektura:"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:143
msgid "<big><b>Loading...</b></big>"
msgstr "<big><b>Ladowanié...</b></big>"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:210 toplevel.cpp:356
msgid ""
"There are unsaved changes in the active module.\n"
"Do you want to apply the changes before running the new module or discard "
"the changes?"
msgstr ""
"Zmianë w biéżny mòdule nie òstałë zapisóné.\n"
"Czë chcesz akceptowac zmianë przed zrëszënim nowégò mòduła, czë cësnąc "
"zdzejóné zmianë?"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:213 toplevel.cpp:359
msgid ""
"There are unsaved changes in the active module.\n"
"Do you want to apply the changes before exiting the Control Center or "
"discard the changes?"
msgstr ""
"Zmianë w biéżny mòdule nie òstałë zapisóné.\n"
"Czë chcesz akceptowac zmianë przed zamkniãcym Centróm kòntrolë, czë cësnąc "
"zdzejóné zmianë?"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:216 toplevel.cpp:362
msgid "Unsaved Changes"
msgstr "Niezapisóné zmianë"

#: helpwidget.cpp:64
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"<p>Use the \"Whats This\" (Shift+F1) to get help on specific options.</"
"p><p>To read the full manual click <a href=\"%1\">here</a>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Brëkùjë fùnkcëji \"Co to je?\" (Shift+F1), żebë zwëskac pòmòc ò apartnëch "
"òptacëjach.</p><p>Żebë przeczëtac ùczbòwnik, klëkni <a href=\"%1\">tuwò</a>."
"</p>"

#: helpwidget.cpp:72
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<h1>KDE Info Center</h1>There is no quick help available for the active "
#| "info module.<br><br>Click <a href = \"kinfocenter/index.html\">here</a> "
